    value: <size=30>KEY BALL</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7_1
    value: <size=30>NEIGHBOR BALL</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_8_1
    value: <size=30>RANDOM BALL</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_9
    value: <size=60>BONUS BINGO</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_10
    value: <size=60>PAYTABLE</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_11
    value: <size=60>PAYTABLE BONUS</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_12
    value: <size=60>WINLINE</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_13
    value: <size=60>BONUS WINLINE</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: "<b><size=19><color=#fff6c2>WELCOME TO THE BINGO LANE SLOT! IN THIS GAME
      YOU WIN BY SPINNING THE REELS\nAND MATCHING SYMBOLS LEFT TO RIGHT. YOU CAN MATCH
      SYMBOLS ON ANY OF THE\n\n25 DIFFERENT WIN LINES! THE WILD SYMBOL                    SUBTITUTES
      FOR ANY\n\nSYMBOL TO HELP YOU GET WINNING COMBINATIONS.\n\n\nTO BEGIN PLAYING
      SIMPLY CHOOSE YOUR DESIRED COIN SIZE ON THE CONTROL\nPANEL BENEATH THE REELS
      BET BUTTONS AND CLICK SPIN BUTTON.\n\n\nYOUR SELECTED COIN SIZE WILL BE MULTIPLIED
      BY 25(THE NUMBER OF LINES YOU CAN \nWIN ON). ANY WINNINGS WILL BE ADDED TO YOUR
      BALANCE AT THE END OF EACH SPIN!</color></size></b>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: '<b><size=26><color=#fff6c2>ALL WINS PAY LEFT TO RIGHT ON ADJACENT REELS

      BEGINNING WITH LEFTMOST REEL. EXCEPT SCATTERS.


      ALL WINS ARE PAID ON LINES. EXCEPT SCATTERS.

      WHICH ARE ADDED TO LINE WINS.


      HIGHEST WIN PAID ON ANY PLAYED LINE. EXCEPT SCATTERS.


      ALL WINS ARE MULTIPLIED BY THE NUMBER OF COINS BET

      PER LINE. EXCEPT SCATTERS.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>WILDS SUBSTITUTE FOR ALL SYMBOLS.

      WHEN ONE OR MORE WILDS SUBSTITUTE IN A WIN.

      HIGHEST WIN IS PAID.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>SOME SYMBOLS IN THE MAIN GAME WILL CONTAIN
      SUB

      SYMBOL LETTERS ON THEM.

      IF ALL THE LETTERS FROM THE WORD BINGO ARE PRESENT IN

      A SPIN AS SUBSYMBOLS THE FREE SPIN BONUS ROUND

      WILL BE TRIGGERED.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>PLAYER IS AWARDED <b><size=25><color=#ffd800>10
      FREE SPINS.</color></size></b> <b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>THE FREE SPINS WILL
      BE

      PLAYED ON A 5X5 BINGO CARD STYLE SET OF REELS.


      IN THE FREE SPINS THERE ARE 3 DIFFRENT TYPES OF WILD SYMBOLS.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>THE               WILL LOCK IN PLACE AND REMAIN
      FOR

      THE REST OF THE FREE SPINS.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_7
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>THE               WILL ALSO MAKE UP TO 4 NEIGHBORING

      SYMBOLS WILD FOR THAT SPIN.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_8
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>THE               WILL ALSO MAKE UP TO 4 RANDOM
      SYMBOLS

      ANYWHERE ON THE REELS WILD FOR THAT SPIN.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_9
    value: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>BINGO''S ARE EARNED BY GETTING VERTICAL. HORIZONTAL
      OR

      DIAGONAL GOLDEN LINES OR A GOLDEN SQUARE IN EACH

      CONER PLUS THE CENTER.


      WHENEVER A WILD LANDS IN THE BONUS ROUND IT

      WILL COLOR THE SQUARE GOLD.

      GETTING A BINGO DOUBLES EVERY WIN AFTER A BINGO IS CALLED.</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_10
    value: <b><size=18><color=#fff6c2>OF A KIND</color></size></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_10_1
    value: <b><size=18><color=#fff6c2>ALL PAYS SHOWN WITH A WAGER OF 1 COIN.</color></size></b>
